WEBVTT

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.816
Robert, thank you so much for that.
Good luck with the book.

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:32.096
That was amazing,

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:35.296
and we're going to try and get you
to come here in person one year.

00:15:35.320 --> 00:15:36.536
Thank you so much.

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.040
RS: Thank you. Thank you all.